* @title REVERSE turns a string end for end
* @attribution Ported from Phil Budne's CSNOBOL4 test suite (reverse.sno).
* @expect >>>
* hello world
* paul is dead
* ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ
* <<<
	OUTPUT = REVERSE("dlrow olleh")
	OUTPUT = REVERSE("daed si luap")
	OUTPUT = REVERSE(REVERSE(&UCASE))
END
